1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:03,945
Dinner's ready!

2
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:12,490
- A monster! There's a monster!
- Hm? Keep it down.

3
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,010
What nonsense are you on about?

4
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:20,000
Well, everyone. Have you noticed
you've been shrunk again?

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,460
You did it again!
Change us back!

6
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,980
Natsumi, you'll break it!

7
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,890
Oh, didn't I tell you?

8
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,040
The Nano Cannon that shrank you
was only a prototype.

9
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:47,340
So you can't change all the way back
without this Nano Card here.

10
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:53,810
Why, you...!

11
00:00:54,980 --> 00:01:00,370
This time I'll finish the Nano Cannon
and give the Earth to the monkeys!

12
00:01:00,910 --> 00:01:02,410
Well, do your best.

13
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,930
Bye-bye.

14
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:11,350
We have to hurry. Specter really
means to fire the Nano Cannon!

15
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,900
We have to stop him!
But how do we get to Specter?

16
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,460
For now, let's find the monkeys
Specter is still controlling.

17
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:29,230
If we ride on those monkeys' heads,
we should get Specter's data.

18
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:33,540
All right, let's get going!

